    "url": "https://einfach-elterngeld.de/en/bayern",
    "title": "Parental allowance Offices in Bavaria: Contact | Opening hours",
    "text": "Parental allowance Offices in Bavaria: Contact | Opening hours Apply for Parental Allowance in Bavaria Find here all the information and applications you need to apply for parental allowance in Bavaria Parental allowance is an income substitution benefit for parents who limit their employment in whole or in part after childbirth in favor of childcare. In Bavaria, the state authorities of the respective administrative districts are responsible for setting the parental allowance. The parental allowance application is completed and subCenterd together for both parents. In addition to the main request, there are various supplementary facilities The clerks of the parental benefit agency usually set their parental allowance as you requested. They do not do a cheap test for you and they are not obliged to make suggestions for improvement. Plan Parental Allowance The regulations of the parents money have become confusing and complicated. We recommend all parents to deal with the topic in a timely and thorough manner. On our website einfach-elterngeld.de we compile comprehensive information material to help you plan your parental allowance optimally for your family and financial situation. Take advantage of our service Take advantage of our parental allowance calculator and test different options. You can easily and intuitively try out what it's like if you're gainfully employed during your reference period and much more. With our own created for you Parental Allowance Software you can automatically and intuitively create your parental allowance and child benefit application. If you need a comprehensive Personal advice our experts are at your disposal. Parental Allowance Officen und Elterngeldantrag Bayern Here you will find the application forms from Bavaria. The applications apply to children born after 01.07.2015. Bavaria Lower Bavaria Middle Franconia Upper Bavaria Upper Franconia Upper Palatinate Swabians Lower Franconia Please first select your appropriate administrative district: Address Zentrum Bayern Familie und Soziales Region Niederbayern 84026 Landshut E-Mail poststelle.ndb@zbfs.bayern.de Fax 0871 829 188 Website Regional Office Lower Bavaria Address Zentrum Bayern Familie und Soziales Region Mittelfranken 90336 Nürnberg E-Mail poststelle.mfr@zbfs.bayern.de Fax 0911 928 1901 Website Regional Office Middle Franconia Address Zentrum Bayern Familie und Soziales Region Oberbayern 80323 München E-Mail poststelle.obb@zbfs.bayern.de Fax 089 18966 1499 Website regional office Upper Bavaria Address Zentrum Bayern Familie und Soziales Region Oberfranken 95440 Bayreuth E-Mail poststelle.ofr@zbfs.bayern.de Fax 0921 605 2900 Website Regional Office Upper Franconia Address Zentrum Bayern Familie und Soziales Region Oberpfalz Landshuter Straße 55 93053 Regensburg E-Mail poststelle.opf@zbfs.bayern.de Fax 0941 7809 1304 Website Regional Office Upper Palatinate Address Zentrum Bayern Familie und Soziales Region Schwaben 86135 Augsburg E-Mail poststelle.schw@zbfs.bayern.de Fax 0821 5709 9001 Website Regional Office Schwaben Address Zentrum Bayern Familie und Soziales Region Unterfranken Postfach 53 09 97003 Würzburg E-Mail poststelle.ufr@zbfs.bayern.de Fax 0931 4107 222 Website Regional office Lower Franconia With the parental allowance software, you can have your parental leave application filled in fully automatically! Quick to use and easy to explain No subscription - once 24,95 € Detailed advice with own wiki Can be used in all current web-enabled browsers View more details only 24,95 € incl. VAT benefit now Mehr Infos Sign in × E-Mail: Password: Remember Forgot your password? Close Sign in More info",
